{"id":280,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"言葉で生きる力を6年間で培うキリスト教教育","feature_description":"捜真女学校はキリスト教教育を土台に、言葉を使って生きていく力を育てることを教育の柱にしています。中学部と高等学部の6年間を二年ごとの三段階に分け、基礎から発展へと学びを組み立てます。英語ではラウンド方式を取り入れ、実体験や校外での学びも重ねます。知識だけでなく、言葉で考え伝え、他者と関わる力を伸ばす方針です。実社会と結び付ける学習も重視します。","clubs":[{"id":4162,"name":"合気道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://soshin.ac.jp/jogakko/club_committee_event_sj/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4163,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://soshin.ac.jp/jogakko/club_committee_event_sj/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4164,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://soshin.ac.jp/jogakko/club_committee_event_sj/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4165,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://soshin.ac.jp/jogakko/club_committee_event_sj/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4166,"name":"空手道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://soshin.ac.jp/jogakko/club_committee_event_sj/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4167,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://soshin.ac.jp/jogakko/club_committee_event_sj/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4168,"name":"新体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://soshin.ac.jp/jogakko/club_committee_event_sj/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4169,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://soshin.ac.jp/jogakko/club_committee_event_sj/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4170,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://soshin.ac.jp/jogakko/club_committee_event_sj/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4171,"name":"弦楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://soshin.ac.jp/jogakko/club_committee_event_sj/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4172,"name":"ブラスバンド部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://soshin.ac.jp/jogakko/club_committee_event_sj/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4173,"name":"聖歌隊","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://soshin.ac.jp/jogakko/club_committee_event_sj/","verified_at":"2026-11-1